The average age of 5 students is 20 years. When a sixth student joins the group, the average age becomes 21 years. What is the age of the sixth student?
A) 24 years
B) 25 years
C) 26 years
D) 27 years
Solution : 
          5M/5=20
          a+b+c+d+e=5*20  ==100
          a+b+c+d+e+f/6 = 21
          100 + f =126
          f = 26
          
Answer: C) 26 years
